            "detailed_description": "Engage in a fantastic mini race in unexpected places. Choose your favorite ZRacer and fight your way through 16 tracks in 4 awesome worlds. Grab ZBags and unleash power-ups on your foes! Be in the podium to earn Zcoins and improve your racer with several new equipment! Master 3 different game modes and explore levels to discover the full history of each racer.<br />\r\n- Deal with Meatballs!<br />\r\n- Scape from dirty rats!<br />\r\n- Slide trough wet marble!<br />\r\n- Fight giant AntZ!<br />\r\n- Much more!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFEATURES:<br />\r\n- Classic top down gameplay blending micromachines and mario kart!<br />\r\n- Intuitive Gameplay<br />\r\n- 16 creative tracks<br />\r\n- 10 awesome ZDrivers with history and individual endings<br />\r\n- 13 unique powerups!<br />\r\n- 18 items to improve your Zkart!<br />\r\n- 10 Trophies",
